WEBVTT

00:09:00.101 --> 00:09:01.523
MJ: Jacqueline Culp.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.377
Pianist: Trayvon Martin.

00:09:04.021 --> 00:09:05.355
AYGTK: Sandra Bland.

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:07.831
Dan yang lainnya.

00:09:08.834 --> 00:09:12.849
Warisan 1901 adil bertahan

00:09:12.873 --> 00:09:16.103
lebih banyak dari yang kita bayangkan.

00:09:18.315 --> 00:09:19.498
MJ: Mary Talbert

00:09:19.522 --> 00:09:21.623
dan Asosiasi Nasional
Wanita Berwarna

00:09:21.647 --> 00:09:24.522
memulai gerakan melawan 
hukuman mati tanpa pengadilan

00:09:24.546 --> 00:09:26.537
dan mitos kriminalitas kulit hitam

00:09:26.561 --> 00:09:30.101
sama seperti wanita kulit hitam hari ini
mulai Black Lives Matter.